# QuoteGuard API examples (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client). No credentials included.
# Full OpenAPI: {{base}}/api/docs
@base = http://localhost:8251
@csrf = paste-qg_csrf-cookie-value-here

### Health and safe readiness (no secrets)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/ready

### Sign in (sets HttpOnly qg_session + readable qg_csrf cookies)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "<demo username>", "password": "<demo password>"}

### Create a request (mutations need X-CSRF-Token)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"text": "Buy 30 USB-C headsets with microphones. Total budget $600 including shipping and stated taxes. Delivery within seven calendar days."}

### Confirm requirements (immutable version)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"requirements": {"item": "USB-C headsets", "quantity": 30, "budget_amount": "600.00", "currency": "USD", "deadline_days": 7, "mandatory": [{"key": "connector", "label": "USB-C connector", "expected": "USB-C", "synonyms": ["usb-c"]}]}, "expected_version": 0}

### Upload a quote PDF
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/documents
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="quote.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../fixtures/samples/ClearWave_Supplies_quote_DEMO.pdf
--b--

### Comparison (deterministic outcomes + evidence links)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/comparison

### What-if preview (read-only)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/whatif
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"budget": "650.00"}

### Review exact terms, then approve with the terms hash you reviewed (approver role)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/approval-review?quote_id=<quote_id>

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/approvals
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"quote_id": "<quote_id>", "terms_hash": "<64-hex from review>"}

### Start checkout — body accepts NO amount or payee (unknown fields → 422)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/approvals/<approval_id>/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{}

### Capture after buyer approval in PayPal (idempotent; duplicates return the same operation)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/payments/<operation_id>/capture
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{}

### Reconcile with PayPal (authoritative lookup)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/payments/<operation_id>/reconcile
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Evidence package
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests/<request_id>/export.json

### Demo Lab scenario (demo workspace admin)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/demo/scenarios/lost_response
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### PayPal webhook endpoint (called by PayPal; verified server-side, no login)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/webhooks/paypal
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "WH-EXAMPLE", "event_type": "PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED", "resource": {"id": "CAPTURE_ID"}}
